{
  "source_poem_zh": "执手相看泪眼，竟无语凝噎。\n念去去、千里烟波，暮霭沉沉楚天阔。",
  "critical_units": [
    {
      "id": "song_03_u1",
      "source_span": "执手相看泪眼",
      "meaning": "以相握的手和泪眼呈现临别双方。"
    },
    {
      "id": "song_03_u2",
      "source_span": "竟无语凝噎",
      "meaning": "情绪使言语受阻，具体发话者未逐一标明。"
    },
    {
      "id": "song_03_u3",
      "source_span": "念去去、千里烟波",
      "meaning": "由当前分别转向想象远行的漫长水路。"
    },
    {
      "id": "song_03_u4",
      "source_span": "暮霭沉沉楚天阔",
      "meaning": "暮霭和辽阔天空共同营造远阔、低沉的景象。"
    }
  ],
  "translations_to_score": [
    {
      "opaque_id": "xff11a5d1707fd2",
      "translation": "Holding hands, we gaze into each other’s tear-filled eyes,\nChoked with grief, unable to speak.\nI think of the journey onward, farther still—\nA thousand miles of mist-veiled waters,\nEvening haze hanging heavy beneath the vast skies of Chu.",
      "notes": [
        "Chu is an ancient name for a region of southern China."
      ]
    },
    {
      "opaque_id": "xbb923c8818e5d3",
      "translation": "Hand in hand, we gaze through tearful eyes—\nwords choked back, nothing to say.\nI think of the road stretching on:\na thousand miles of misty waters,\ndusk haze sinking beneath the vast Chu sky.",
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "opaque_id": "x2156ef9c4edc29",
      "translation": "Hands clasped, we gaze into each other’s tear-filled eyes,\nchoked with sobs, unable to speak.\nI think of going, farther and farther—\na thousand miles of mist-veiled waters,\nevening haze hanging heavy\nunder the vast skies of Chu.",
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "opaque_id": "x1ddfc919a74769",
      "translation": "Holding hands, we gaze into tear-filled eyes,\nyet neither can speak, choked with sobs.\nThinking of the journey stretching on—\nthousands of miles of misty waters,\ndusk haze deep and heavy beneath Chu’s vast sky.",
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "opaque_id": "x468e094f3f748c",
      "translation": "We clasp hands, gazing into tear-filled eyes,\nyet cannot speak, choked by grief.\nI think of the road stretching on and on—\na thousand miles of mist-veiled waters,\nevening haze sinking heavily beneath the vast Chu sky.",
      "notes": [
        "“Chu” refers to the ancient southern region of China, used here for the distant landscape."
      ]
    },
    {
      "opaque_id": "xf78a1f093702bf",
      "translation": "Hand in hand, we gaze into tear-filled eyes,\nchoked with feeling, unable to speak.\nI imagine the journey ahead—\nthousands of miles through misty waters,\nas dusk settles thick beneath the vast Chu sky.",
      "notes": []
    }
  ]
}

