{
  "source_poem_zh": "自胡马窥江去后，废池乔木，犹厌言兵。\n渐黄昏，清角吹寒，都在空城。",
  "critical_units": [
    {
      "id": "song_06_u1",
      "source_span": "胡马窥江",
      "meaning": "以“胡马”代指来犯兵势，带有历史文化指涉。"
    },
    {
      "id": "song_06_u2",
      "source_span": "废池乔木",
      "meaning": "以残池和高木呈现战后城市景象。"
    },
    {
      "id": "song_06_u3",
      "source_span": "犹厌言兵",
      "meaning": "将废池乔木写成厌恶谈兵，形成拟人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "song_06_u4",
      "source_span": "清角吹寒",
      "meaning": "号角声与寒意相连，听觉引出体感和气氛。"
    }
  ],
  "translations_to_score": [
    {
      "opaque_id": "xc9edd6035ccd78",
      "translation": "Since the northern horsemen threatened the river and withdrew,\nthe ruined ponds and towering trees\nstill shrink from talk of war.\nDusk slowly falls;\na clear horn blows the cold\nthrough the empty city.",
      "notes": [
        "The horsemen are invading cavalry; the river is the Yangtze."
      ]
    },
    {
      "opaque_id": "x13da791956f8fd",
      "translation": "Since the Hu horsemen withdrew from the river,\nthe ruined pools and towering trees\nstill loathe to speak of war.\n\nDusk deepens. A cold horn sounds—\neverywhere, through the empty city.",
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "opaque_id": "xd4c0df056fc509",
      "translation": "Since the northern horsemen came probing south to the river and withdrew, the ruined ponds and towering trees still seem to loathe any talk of war.\nDusk deepens. A clear, cold horn sounds; all of it echoes through the empty city.",
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "opaque_id": "x8878260bac3612",
      "translation": "Since northern horsemen eyed the river\nand withdrew,\nthe ruined pools, the towering trees\nstill shudder at the talk of war.\n\nDusk gathers slowly.\nA clear horn blows the cold—\nall in the empty city.",
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "opaque_id": "x782884f9410b42",
      "translation": "Since the Hu cavalry withdrew after invading the riverbanks,\nthe ruined pools and lofty trees still loathe to speak of war.\nAs dusk slowly falls, a mournful horn sounds through the cold—\nall of it within the empty city.",
      "notes": [
        "“Hu” refers broadly to northern/foreign cavalry in classical Chinese usage.",
        "“清角” is a clear, mournful military horn."
      ]
    },
    {
      "opaque_id": "x3c792848c941bb",
      "translation": "Since the northern horsemen spied upon the river and withdrew,\nthe ruined pools and towering trees\nstill shrink from talk of war.\nDusk slowly gathers;\na clear horn blows the cold\nthrough the empty city.",
      "notes": []
    }
  ]
}

