      "translation": "Why should a man not wear a Wu hook sword,\nTo seize the fifty provinces beyond the passes?\nGo, for a moment, up to Lingyan Pavilion—\nWhich scholar there has been made a marquis of ten thousand households?",
      "notes": [
        "The Wu hook is a famous curved sword; Lingyan Pavilion commemorated eminent meritorious officials."
      ]
    },
    {
      "opaque_id": "x7ab03aee0b7957",
      "translation": "Why should a man not wear a Wu sword,\nand win back the fifty realms beyond the passes?\nCome, climb the Lingyan Pavilion awhile—\nwhich scholar has ever been made a lord of ten thousand households?",
      "notes": [
